  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports procurement spend intelligence and supplier performance at SpendLens. Stakeholders: Category Manager and Sourcing leads (supplier scorecards, contract leakage, category cube), CPO (realized savings, maverick spend, supplier risk), and CFO (procurement cost avoidance, working capital terms, ESG / diversity commitments).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Realized savings = SUM(savings_usd); typical 3–5% of addressable spend, leaders 5–8%.\n- Maverick spend = AVG(maverick_spend_pct); leaders <5%, average 20–30%.\n- On-time delivery = AVG(on_time_delivery_pct); supplier target ≥95%.\n- Quality acceptance = AVG(quality_acceptance_pct); supplier target ≥98%.\n- Contract compliance = AVG(contract_compliance_pct); target ≥85%.\n- PO cycle time = AVG(po_cycle_time_days); target <7 days.\n- Diversity spend = AVG(supplier_diversity_pct); corporate ESG goal.\n- Cost avoidance = SUM(cost_avoidance_usd); supplements hard savings.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - procurement_metrics (source: procurement_transactions) — dims: po_date, spend_category, delivery_status; measures: total_po_amount, total_po_count, maverick_po_count, late_delivery_count, total_invoice_amount, unique_supplier_count.\n  - spend_kpi_metrics (source: spend_kpi_monthly) — dims: kpi_month, spend_category; measures: total_spend, total_savings, avg_maverick_pct, total_cost_avoidance, total_supplier_diversity_percent, unique_supplier_count.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. supplier_id, supplier_score, price_variance_pct, quality_accepted, maverick_spend, payment_terms_days).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Top 10 spend categories by total spend this year — where is procurement leverage concentrated?",
    "What is the monthly trend in realized savings vs maverick spend percentage over the trailing 12 months?",
    "Which suppliers have on-time delivery below the 95% target this quarter?",
    "Rank spend categories by realized savings — which exceed the 5% best-in-class benchmark?",
    "Show monthly trend in cost avoidance vs total spend across the supplier base.",
    "Top 10 suppliers by supplier score — and how does that correlate with total spend?",
    "Which categories have the highest maverick spend percentage, and what is the off-contract dollar value?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in unique total pos?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT po_date, MEASURE(total_po_count) AS total_po_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.procurement_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY po_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has unique suppliers changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT po_date, MEASURE(unique_supplier_count) AS unique_supplier_count",
        "FROM {fqn}.procurement_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY po_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total procurement spend?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, MEASURE(total_spend) AS total_spend",
        "FROM {fqn}.spend_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total supplier diversity pct?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, MEASURE(total_supplier_diversity_percent) AS total_supplier_diversity_percent",
        "FROM {fqn}.spend_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does total purchase order amount in usd break down by supplier identifier for 'On Time' records?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT supplier_id, COUNT(*) AS record_count, SUM(po_amount_usd) AS total_po_amount_usd",
        "FROM {fqn}.procurement_transactions",
        "WHERE delivery_status = 'On Time' GROUP BY supplier_id ORDER BY total_po_amount_usd DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total average lead time in days over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(lead_time_days) AS total_lead_time_days",
        "FROM {fqn}.supplier_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average maverick (off-contract) spend percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(maverick_spend_pct) AS avg_maverick_spend_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.spend_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    }
  ],
